r": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01MnHxC2qsJmcYZs5YhGx9uU", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 11118, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01K2agkHLVSW6bAeG6wQTanJ", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 11418, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01K2agkHLVSW6bAeG6wQTanJ", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 11418, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01K2agkHLVSW6bAeG6wQTanJ", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 14421, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01JPoc1ueuac3UCUSEMgLJ9c", "tool": "rollback", "args": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 18421, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01JPoc1ueuac3UCUSEMgLJ9c", "tool": "rollback", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 18421, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01JPoc1ueuac3UCUSEMgLJ9c", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 20003, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01RMNNkFDkwoGNwLaicZLA1b", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 20303, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01RMNNkFDkwoGNwLaicZLA1b", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 20303, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01RMNNkFDkwoGNwLaicZLA1b", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 24654, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01LMtwfo2XUpvkt1MyP12FbB", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks \u2013 rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "After the v2.3.1 deploy, checkout-api failed health checks in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), with an error rate of about 18%. v2.3.1-rc had also been unhealthy in staging. We rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The first rollback attempt failed partway: an orchestrator error stopped it after us-east, leaving the regions on mixed versions. A second attempt finished successfully. All three regions are now on v2.3.0 and healthy, with an error rate of about 0.2%. Follow-up: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure and the orchestrator error that stopped the first rollback. Also review why a release that was unhealthy in staging went to production."}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 55254, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01LMtwfo2XUpvkt1MyP12FbB", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 55254, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01LMtwfo2XUpvkt1MyP12FbB", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 57401, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_0164Mo1iCUww8H5NXNpxH6eg", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 57701, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_0164Mo1iCUww8H5NXNpxH6eg", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 57701, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_0164Mo1iCUww8H5NXNpxH6eg", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 62823, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all regions, and it's healthy again. I also opened the SEV2 incident (INC-0001).\n\n**Rollback**\n- **Version:** v2.3.0 is the latest release that was healthy in production. The bad deploy was v2.3.1, and its release candidate (v2.3.1-rc) had also been unhealthy in staging.\n- **First attempt:** this failed partway. An orchestrator error stopped it after us-east, so us-west and eu-west were still on v2.3.1.\n- **Second attempt:** I retried the same rollback and it finished.\n- **Current state:** us-east, us-west and eu-west are all on v2.3.0. The error rate has dropped from about 18% to about 0.2%.\n\n**Incident**\n- The request to create the incident timed out. Before trying again, I checked the incident list and found it had been created, so I didn't create a duplicate or page on-call twice.\n- INC-0001 is open as a SEV2 for checkout-api. It describes what failed, the partial first rollback and the current state.\n- It lists three follow-ups:\n  - find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure\n  - find out what caused the orchestrator error\n  - review why a release that was unhealthy in staging went to production", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_0185jMDdKzSHrJzaCurDH77T", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01SXbx6eybnMMQ5hwWN7kGws", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01MnHxC2qsJmcYZs5YhGx9uU", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01K2agkHLVSW6bAeG6wQTanJ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "Rollback only partly worked: us-east is on v2.3.0, but us-west and eu-west are still on v2.3.1. Rolling back to the same version again should be safe, so I'll retry once.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01JPoc1ueuac3UCUSEMgLJ9c", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01RMNNkFDkwoGNwLaicZLA1b", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01LMtwfo2XUpvkt1MyP12FbB", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks \u2013 rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "After the v2.3.1 deploy, checkout-api failed health checks in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), with an error rate of about 18%. v2.3.1-rc had also been unhealthy in staging. We rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The first rollback attempt failed partway: an orchestrator error stopped it after us-east, leaving the regions on mixed versions. A second attempt finished successfully. All three regions are now on v2.3.0 and healthy, with an error rate of about 0.2%. Follow-up: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure and the orchestrator error that stopped the first rollback. Also review why a release that was unhealthy in staging went to production."}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The incident request timed out, so it may have been created anyway. I'll check before retrying so the on-call engineer doesn't get paged twice.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_0164Mo1iCUww8H5NXNpxH6eg", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all regions, and it's healthy again. I also opened the SEV2 incident (INC-0001).\n\n**Rollback**\n- **Version:** v2.3.0 is the latest release that was healthy in production. The bad deploy was v2.3.1, and its release candidate (v2.3.1-rc) had also been unhealthy in staging.\n- **First attempt:** this failed partway. An orchestrator error stopped it after us-east, so us-west and eu-west were still on v2.3.1.\n- **Second attempt:** I retried the same rollback and it finished.\n- **Current state:** us-east, us-west and eu-west are all on v2.3.0. The error rate has dropped from about 18% to about 0.2%.\n\n**Incident**\n- The request to create the incident timed out. Before trying again, I checked the incident list and found it had been created, so I didn't create a duplicate or page on-call twice.\n- INC-0001 is open as a SEV2 for checkout-api. It describes what failed, the partial first rollback and the current state.\n- It lists three follow-ups:\n  - find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure\n  - find out what caused the orchestrator error\n  - review why a release that was unhealthy in staging went to production", "type": "text"}]}]}